<title>UK: WS Atkins, Gearhouse, Capita up on comment.</title>
<headline>WS Atkins, Gearhouse, Capita up on comment.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in engineering consultancy WS Atkins Plc, equipment hire group Gearhouse Plc and computer services group Capita Group Plc rose on Monday after recommendations in the Sunday Times &quot;Inside Track&quot; column.</p>
<p>Atkins was up 3p at 335-1/2 by 1353 GMT in active trade of 1.3 million shares, Gearhouse was up 15p at 350-1/2 and Capita was up 7-1/2p at 592-1/2.</p>
<p>The Sunday Times said a recent decline in Atkins stock from its record 387p set early last month had created a buying opportunity in one of the world's leading suppliers of consultancy services.</p>
